    "For now we'll start without setting up notifications. What matters most is having support ready when a craving hits." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For now we'll start without setting up notifications. What matters most is having support ready when a craving hits."
